  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 35 + 60 ÷ 12 × 4 − 12 = 203\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) - and +\n\n35 + 60 ÷ 12 × 4 − 12 = 203 ⇒ 35 - 60 ÷ 12 × 4 + 12 = 203\n\n⇒ 35 - __**60 ÷ 12**__ × 4 + 12 = 203\n\n⇒ 35 - __**5 × 4**__ + 12 = 203\n\n⇒ __**35 + 12**__ - 20 = 203\n\n⇒ __**47 - 20**__ = 203\n\n⇒ 27 ≠ 203 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) + and ×\n\n35 + 60 ÷ 12 × 4 − 12 = 203 ⇒ 35 × 60 ÷ 12 + 4 − 12 = 203\n\n⇒ 35 × __**60 ÷ 12**__ + 4 − 12 = 203\n\n⇒ __**35 ×**____** 5**__ + 4 − 12 = 203\n\n⇒ __**175**____** + 4**__ − 12 = 203\n\n⇒ __**179**____** − 12**__ = 203\n\n⇒ 167 ≠ 203 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) ÷ and ×\n\n35 + 60 ÷ 12 × 4 − 12 = 203 ⇒ 35 + 60 × 12 ÷ 4 − 12 = 203\n\n⇒ 35 + 60 × __**12 **____**÷**____** 4**__ − 12 = 203\n\n⇒ 35 + __**60 **____**× 3**__ − 12 = 203\n\n⇒ __**35 + 180**__ − 12 = 203\n\n⇒ __**215**____** − 12**__ = 203\n\n⇒ 203 = 203 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 4) - and ×\n\n35 + 60 ÷ 12 × 4 − 12 = 203 ⇒ 35 + 60 ÷ 12 - 4 × 12 = 203\n\n⇒ 35 + __**60 ÷ 12**__ - 4 × 12 = 203\n\n⇒ 35 + 5 - __**4 **____**×**____** 12**__ = 203\n\n⇒ __**35 + 5**__ - 48 = 203\n\n⇒ __**40 - 48**__ = 203\n\n⇒ 8 ≠ 203 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
